OL,3,GNEWSAMan and boy's deaths during water
OL,4,Aactivities 'could have been avoided'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deaths of a boy and a man who
OL,7,Fdrowned five years apart during outdoor
OL,8,Fwater activities could have been
OL,9,Favoided, a joint fatal accident inquiry
OL,10,F(FAI) has found.
OL,12,FKayden Walker, 12, died after he became
OL,13,Ftrapped on the upstream side of a weir
OL,14,Fon the River Tay in Perthshire in July
OL,15,F2019 while on a supervised trip.
OL,17,FRuaridh Stevenson, 39, drowned after he
OL,18,Ftried to help a client who got into
OL,19,Fdifficulty in the waters flowing
OL,20,Fthrough Dollar Glen, Clackmannanshire,
OL,21,Fin April 2024.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
