OL,3,GNEWSAMan and boy's deaths during water
OL,4,Aactivities 'could have been avoided'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his determination, Sheriff Keith
OL,7,FO'Mahony identified precautions which
OL,8,Fmight realistically have prevented both
OL,9,Fdeaths.
